{
    "inspire-hep": "[Belle:2013hlo](https://inspirehep.net/literature/1238273)",
    "author": "Sibidanov, A. and others",
    "collaboration": "Belle",
    "title": "Study of Exclusive $\\bar{B} \\to X_u \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$ Decays and Extraction of $|V_{ub}|$ using Full Reconstruction Tagging",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/1306.2781v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1306.2781)",
    "time": "2013.06.12",
    "abstract": "We report the results of a study of the exclusive semileptonic decays $B^- \\to \\pi^0 \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$, $\\bar{B}^0 \\to \\pi^+ \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$, $B^- \\to \\rho^0 \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$, $\\bar{B}^0 \\to \\rho^+ \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$ and $B^- \\to \\omega \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell$, where $\\ell$ represents an electron or a muon. The events are tagged by fully reconstructing a second $B$ meson in the event in a hadronic decay mode. The measured branching fractions are $\\mathcal{B}(B^- \\to \\pi^0 \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell) = (0.80 \\pm 0.08 \\pm 0.04) \\times 10^{-4}$, $\\mathcal{B}(\\bar{B}^0 \\to \\pi^+ \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell) = (1.49 \\pm 0.09 \\pm 0.07) \\times 10^{-4}$, $\\mathcal{B}(B^- \\to \\rho^0 \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell) = (1.83 \\pm 0.10 \\pm 0.10) \\times 10^{-4}$, $\\mathcal{B}(\\bar{B}^0 \\to \\rho^+ \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell) = (3.22 \\pm 0.27 \\pm 0.24) \\times 10^{-4}$, and $\\mathcal{B}(B^- \\to \\omega \\ell^- \\bar{\\nu}_\\ell) = (1.07 \\pm 0.16 \\pm 0.07) \\times 10^{-4}$. Using the pion modes, a value of $|V_{ub}| = (3.52 \\pm 0.29) \\times 10^{-3}$ is extracted.",
    "pdf": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1306.2781",
    "transition-mode": "semi-leptonic decay",
